[sai-00113] helpful=0 harmful=0 :: For complex business proposals involving financial analysis, perform a 'Pre-Drafting Financial Model' before writing any prose. Explicitly calculate all currency conversions (e.g., USD to INR) and cost breakdowns (components, assembly, overhead) in a scratchpad area. Only after these figures are finalized and verified against the rubric should you draft the narrative, ensuring the calculated values are embedded directly into the proposal.
