[sai-00117] helpful=1 harmful=0 :: helpful=0 harmful=0 :: When tasked with creating curriculum-based presentations (e.g., training manuals, parenting programs) from provided source documents, perform a 'Rubric-to-Slide' mapping before drafting. Create a table that maps every mandatory activity, safety protocol, and required prompt from the source material to a specific slide. Do not begin drafting until every rubric item is assigned to a slide, and perform a final 'Compliance Audit' to verify that no granular pedagogical requirements were omitted in favor of generic presentation structure.
