[sai-00174] helpful=1 harmful=0 :: When tasked with creating technical reference guides (e.g., pharmacy billing, clinical manuals), perform a 'Rubric-to-Data-Field' mapping. Create a table that lists every rubric-mandated data field (e.g., NDC, strength, package size, formula) as a column header. Do not begin drafting the document until you have populated this table with the required data for every item mentioned in the prompt. This ensures the final output is a data-rich reference guide rather than a high-level summary.
